  "economic_hypothesis": "A regime-conditioned Expected-P/E challenger may add persistent valuation information, but routing it on same-row observed-P/E loss selects transient market noise. A fully matured 21-session future-observed-multiple proxy and a bounded raw-ML-anchored soft weight should improve latent/fair evaluation without winner-take-most branch flips.",
